				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Pursuant to the instructions received from the esteemed office of "
        + $F{insurer}
        + " on "
        + ($F{deputation_date} == null ? "N/A" : new java.text.SimpleDateFormat("dd/MM/yyyy").format($F{deputation_date}))
        + ", the undersigned approached the spot location and conducted a thorough inspection of the vehicle involved in the accident. The circumstances and cause of loss were briefly discussed with the representative. The undersigned meticulously examined the vehicle through our AI-DMS Portal, documented all visible damages. Further, photographs and video were collected with date & time and live location from various angles including the surrounding area for reference. The same are enclosed herewith this report."]]></textFieldExpression>
