					<font fontName="Serif" isBold="false" isItalic="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[During the survey, utmost care and caution were exercised to ensure that all damages were duly noted. However, in the event that any damage remains unnoticed or is discovered after the insured vehicle is dismantled, it is advised that the final surveyor make an appropriate decision regarding the matter. This approach emphasizes the importance of thorough assessment and allows for any unforeseen damages to be addressed accordingly.]]></text>
			</staticText>
